  - partName: Auricular tubercle.l
    systemName: Skeletal System
    partType: Bony Landmark / Feature
    description: "A prominent osseous projection and morphological landmark (Auricular tubercle) formed on the cortical surface of the parent bone."
    function: "Expands mechanical surface area for the strong anchorage of tendons and ligaments, enhancing biomechanical lever arms and distributing joint stresses."
    location: "Projecting from the surface of the bone in the head and cranial region. Left side (bilateral structure)."
