  - partName: Extensor carpi radialis brevis.el
    systemName: Muscular Insertions
    partType: Muscular Insertion
    description: "Represents the anatomical insertion (distal/mobile attachment enthesis) of the Extensor carpi radialis brevis. At this site, the muscle's terminal tendon or aponeurosis fuses with the cortical bone matrix."
