    function: "Secures the proximal tendon of the Tibialis posterior muscle firmly to skeletal bone, providing a stable mechanical base that absorbs reaction forces during dynamic muscular contraction."
    location: "Located at the proximal bony origin site within the lower leg (crural region). Left side (bilateral structure)."
