    systemName: Cardiovascular System
    partType: Artery
    description: "A high-pressure arterial vessel (Medial basal segmental artery of left lung) composed of three concentric histological layers - tunica intima, media (smooth muscle and elastin), and adventitia."
    function: "Distributes pulsatile oxygenated blood and essential metabolic nutrients to the tissues, skeletal muscles, and viscera of the thoracic (chest) cavity and thoracic wall."
    location: "Courses along the neurovascular plane of the thoracic (chest) cavity and thoracic wall. Left side (bilateral structure)."
    fmaId: 
